1499: C0      	            RET  NZ
149A: 23      	            INC  HL
149B: 18F9    	            JR   SKIP_SPACES
              	
              	; --- SKIP_SPACES_DE: Avança DE sobre espaços ---
149D:         	SKIP_SPACES_DE:
